(text "CARRIER - instrument side (generated by gen_carrier_sch.py; do not edit by hand). Everything here is powered by the Pico's own USB; nothing is fed from the DUT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "40dc208b-4ed3-533c-ad46-8ceb43e049c1"))
(text "INSTR_3V3 comes only from Pico pin 36 (3V3_OUT). Pico VBUS (40) and VSYS (39) are left unconnected. Pico, MikroE and microSD plug into Harwin sockets J1-J5." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21c6309f-5563-5730-9613-6fc3449fbd50"))
(text "J2 pin k = Pico pin 20+k; J4 pin k = MikroE pin 8+k. Physical socket order is fixed at footprint stage (Pico pin 21 is opposite pin 20)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "db9ef8ef-6842-5d33-b108-ea8a722dc01b"))
(text "Sense: J7 -> C1 (100n across the Kelvin pair, close to the module) -> J6 wire pads -> MikroE IN1+ / IN1- / IN2 VBUS screw terminals. J7 pin 4 is the shared ground reference." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "58c61918-ff0f-527e-be69-eda2659f4e98"))
(text "UART (docs/uart-interface-qualification.md): U1 is USB-powered. Keep UART_OE_N high (R4) until the Pico has set up its pins. Pico TX is normal polarity (R5 idle-high)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a6be982-9af5-54e1-a383-7486cf1f793b"))
(text "R2/R3 load the Pi outputs (approved UART-bias exception). R1 is the 470R source resistor for Pico->Pi. U1 channel 4 unused: input low, enable high." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9877ca26-133b-523e-949e-8eec0cd67652"))
(text "Indicators: Pico GP7-GP11 -> 1.8k -> red LED -> ground." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 297.18 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2a65e6c1-152a-5880-b46a-b78c14467997"))
